# Eval slice for ponytail + wiki-gate claims (C-0116..C-0118). Format: <query> ||| <token that must stay retrievable in CLAIMS.md>
how is ponytail installed in this repo? ||| vendored into both the Claude Code and Pi harnesses
why did ponytail stop working after switching providers? ||| every machine-local `.claude/settings-*.json` provider file
how do claims get into CLAIMS.md? ||| only through gate.py with an ADMIT verdict
